{"item": "m185", "oracle_pass": false, "evidence": "checker: Rule judge for NUM with 5% relative tolerance: parsed model=[0.735, 0.56], reference=[0.735, 0.73]; mismatches: #2: 0.56 != 0.73 (relative error 0.2329) ", "skill_hash": "5f61deb4e13b", "truth_source": "checker", "skill_result": "(0.735, 0.560)", "failure_reason": "半径比 0.735 本身无误，但它已越过 NaCl 型（CN=6）的上界 0.732，落入 CsCl 型（CN=8）区间，故 packing factor 应按 CsCl 结构处理：每晶胞 1 个 KCl，点阵参数由体对角线接触 $a=2(r_{+}+r_{-})/\\sqrt{3}$ 决定。该解答却套用 NaCl 约定（每胞 4 个 KCl、$a=2(r_{+}+r_{-})$），误判了配位与单胞内容，导致 packing factor 系统偏小。判据要点：先由半径比区间定结构，再据此选单胞公式，而非默认 NaCl。"}
